      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-10T20:20:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Internally we won\u0027t call those functions for depth and stencil formats. But in theory even if we did, those calls would try to find say Stencil8 in the format table, not find anything, and thus return false. And that is what we want to happen. So I don\u0027t think we need to have these formats in the table.",
